fixture cam_look_then_updash
doc Camera review round 2: look down from the ledge for a second, then jump, air jump and up-dash (cam_updash after a look)
room test/camera
spawn 1800 1600
frames 200
input
  0..69 D
  70..92 jump
  93 jump !jump
  94..114 jump
  115 U dash
  116..130 U
end
expect
  at 70 event.jump=1
  at 93 event.air_jump=1
  at 115 event.dash=1
end
